#: ../../api.rst:2
msgid "API reference"
msgstr "API 参考"

#: ../../api.rst:4
msgid ""
"These pages are generated from the installed public exports and their docstrings. "
"Each build validates that public classes, Python methods and properties have English "
"documentation."
msgstr "这些页面根据已安装包的公开接口及文档字符串生成。每次构建都会检查公开类、Python 方法和属性是否具有英文文档。"

#: ../../api/_generated/pymarvin.rst:2
msgid "Public package API"
msgstr "包的公开接口"

#: ../../api/_generated/pymarvin.rst:5
msgid "pymarvin.Marvin_Robot"
msgstr "pymarvin.Marvin_Robot"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot:1
msgid ""
"Basic controller interface. Clear the command batch, set parameters, then send it. "
"Instances share SDK state."
msgstr "基础控制器接口：清空指令批次、设置参数，然后发送；实例共享 SDK 状态。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Concise_Marvin_Robot.connect:1
#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.connect:1
msgid ""
"Connect to the controller at an IPv4 address. The concise interface also configures "
"controller logging."
msgstr "连接到指定 IPv4 地址的控制器；简化接口还会设置控制器日志开关。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Concise_Marvin_Robot.subscribe:1
#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.subscribe:1
msgid ""
"Fill a DCSS record and return its nested state dictionary. The concise interface "
"returns None on failure."
msgstr "填充 DCSS 记录并返回嵌套状态字典；简化接口在失败时返回 None。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Concise_Marvin_Robot.check_error_and_clear:1
#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.check_error_and_clear:1
msgid "Inspect arm and servo errors and request error clearing when necessary."
msgstr "检查机械臂和伺服错误，并在需要时请求清错。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Concise_Marvin_Robot.release_robot:1
#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.release_robot:1
msgid ""
"Release the shared controller connection. Repeated release before initialization is "
"safe."
msgstr "释放共享的控制器连接；未初始化时重复释放是安全的。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Concise_Marvin_Robot.SDK_version:1
#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.SDK_version:1
msgid "Return the version reported by the compiled control SDK."
msgstr "返回已编译控制 SDK 报告的版本号。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.check_sdk_type_compat:1
msgid ""
"Check C type sizes, pack(4) layout and byte order. Return the SDK status and byte-"
"order indicator."
msgstr "检查 C 类型大小、pack(4) 布局和字节序，返回 SDK 状态和字节序标志。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Concise_Marvin_Robot.update_SDK:1
#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.update_SDK:1
msgid "Upload a local controller system update package. Check the returned SDK status."
msgstr "上传本地控制器系统升级包，并检查 SDK 返回状态。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Concise_Marvin_Robot.download_sdk_log:1
#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.download_sdk_log:1
msgid "Download controller logs to the requested local path."
msgstr "将控制器日志下载到指定本地路径。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Concise_Marvin_Robot.get_param:1
#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.get_param:1
msgid ""
"Read an integer or floating-point parameter by its ASCII controller parameter name. "
"Return (status, value)."
msgstr "通过 ASCII 控制器参数名称读取整数或浮点参数，返回 (status, value)。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Concise_Marvin_Robot.save_para_file:1
#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.save_para_file:1
msgid "Save the current controller configuration parameters."
msgstr "保存当前控制器配置参数。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Concise_Marvin_Robot.set_param:1
#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.set_param:1
msgid "Write an integer or floating-point controller parameter and return the SDK status."
msgstr "写入整数或浮点控制器参数，并返回 SDK 状态。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.clear_set:1
msgid "Clear the pending command batch before appending basic-interface commands."
msgstr "在添加基础接口指令前清空待发送指令批次。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.send_cmd:1
msgid "Send the pending basic-interface command batch to the controller."
msgstr "将基础接口的待发送指令批次发送给控制器。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.send_cmd_wait_response:1
msgid ""
"Send the pending command batch and wait for a response using the SDK timeout in "
"milliseconds."
msgstr "发送待处理指令批次，并按 SDK 毫秒超时等待响应。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.collect_data:1
msgid ""
"Start recording up to 35 telemetry fields identified by targetID. The identifier "
"buffer is padded to 35 entries."
msgstr "开始记录 targetID 指定的最多 35 项遥测数据，标识缓冲区会补齐为 35 项。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Concise_Marvin_Robot.stop_collect_data:1
#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.stop_collect_data:1
msgid "Stop recording controller telemetry."
msgstr "停止记录控制器遥测数据。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.save_collected_data_to_path:1
msgid "Save recorded telemetry to a local data file."
msgstr "将采集的遥测数据保存到本地数据文件。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.save_collected_data_as_csv_to_path:1
msgid "Save recorded telemetry to a local CSV file using the official conversion format."
msgstr "使用官方转换格式将采集的遥测数据保存为本地 CSV 文件。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Concise_Marvin_Robot.soft_stop:1
#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.soft_stop:1
msgid "Request a software emergency stop for arm A, B or both arms (AB)."
msgstr "请求 A 臂、B 臂或双臂 AB 的软件急停。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Concise_Marvin_Robot.servo_reset:1
#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.servo_reset:1
msgid "Reset the specified servo axis, numbered 0 through 6, on arm A or B."
msgstr "复位 A 臂或 B 臂上指定的伺服轴，轴编号为 0 到 6。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Concise_Marvin_Robot.get_servo_error_code:1
#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.get_servo_error_code:1
msgid ""
"Read servo fault codes and return their descriptions in the selected CN or EN "
"language."
msgstr "读取伺服故障码，并返回所选 CN 或 EN 语言的故障描述。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.clear_error:1
msgid "Append an error-clear command for arm A or B to the pending batch."
msgstr "向待发送批次中添加 A 臂或 B 臂的清错指令。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.set_state:1
msgid ""
"Set the target arm state: 0 disabled, 1 position, 2 PVT, 3 torque, or 4 cooperative "
"release."
msgstr "设置机械臂目标状态：0 下使能、1 位置、2 PVT、3 扭矩或 4 协作释放。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.set_impedance_type:1
msgid "Select joint (1), Cartesian (2) or force (3) impedance for arm A or B."
msgstr "为 A 臂或 B 臂选择关节 (1)、笛卡尔 (2) 或力 (3) 阻抗。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.set_vel_acc:1
msgid ""
"Set arm velocity and acceleration percentages. These limits do not constrain PVT "
"playback or dragging."
msgstr "设置机械臂速度和加速度百分比；这些限制不约束 PVT 回放或拖动。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Concise_Marvin_Robot.set_tool:1
#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.set_tool:1
msgid ""
"Set six tool kinematic parameters and ten tool dynamic parameters for the selected "
"arm."
msgstr "为指定机械臂设置 6 项工具运动学参数和 10 项工具动力学参数。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.set_joint_kd_params:1
msgid "Set seven joint stiffness values K and seven damping values D for arm A or B."
msgstr "为 A 臂或 B 臂设置 7 项关节刚度 K 和 7 项阻尼 D。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.set_cart_kd_params:1
msgid ""
"Set seven Cartesian/null-space stiffness and damping values and the Cartesian "
"impedance type (default 2)."
msgstr "设置 7 项笛卡尔及零空间刚度、阻尼参数，并选择笛卡尔阻抗类型，默认值为 2。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.set_force_control_params:1
msgid ""
"Set the force-control mode, six-dimensional force direction, seven control parameters"
" and adjustment limit."
msgstr "设置力控模式、六维力方向、7 项控制参数和调节限幅。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.set_EefCart_control_params:1
msgid "Set the end-effector Cartesian rotation mode and its seven control parameters."
msgstr "设置末端笛卡尔旋转模式及其 7 项控制参数。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.set_joint_cmd_pose:1
msgid "Append a seven-joint position command in degrees for arm A or B."
msgstr "为 A 臂或 B 臂添加单位为度的七关节位置指令。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Concise_Marvin_Robot.set_force_cmd:1
#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.set_force_cmd:1
msgid ""
"Set the target force for the selected arm in newtons (or torque in newton-metres as "
"defined by the mode)."
msgstr "设置指定机械臂的目标力，单位为牛顿，或按模式定义设置单位为牛米的扭矩。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Concise_Marvin_Robot.ft_arm_control:1
#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.ft_arm_control:1
msgid ""
"Apply an FTCmd force/torque command by value. Distances use millimetres and angles "
"use degrees."
msgstr "按值应用 FTCmd 力及扭矩指令，距离单位为毫米，角度单位为度。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Concise_Marvin_Robot.set_user_specified_data:1
#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.set_user_specified_data:1
msgid "Select user telemetry category data for arm A, B or both arms (AB)."
msgstr "为 A 臂、B 臂或双臂 AB 选择用户遥测数据类别。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.set_pvt_id:1
msgid "Select and run the uploaded PVT trajectory identifier for the selected arm."
msgstr "选择并运行指定机械臂上已上传的 PVT 轨迹编号。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.send_pvt_file:1
msgid "Upload a local PVT trajectory file for the selected arm and identifier."
msgstr "按照指定机械臂和编号上传本地 PVT 轨迹文件。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.set_drag_space:1
msgid "Set the SDK dragging-space mode for the selected arm; zero exits dragging."
msgstr "设置指定机械臂的 SDK 拖动空间模式，零值表示退出拖动。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.receive_file:1
msgid "Download a controller file from remote_path to local_path."
msgstr "将控制器的 remote_path 文件下载至 local_path。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.send_file:1
msgid "Upload local_path to the controller file path remote_path."
msgstr "将 local_path 文件上传至控制器的 remote_path 路径。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.log_switch:1
msgid "Set controller logging using the official on/off flag convention."
msgstr "按官方 on/off 标志约定设置控制器日志开关。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.local_log_switch:1
msgid "Set local SDK logging using the official on/off flag convention."
msgstr "按官方 on/off 标志约定设置本地 SDK 日志开关。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Concise_Marvin_Robot.pln_init:1
#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.pln_init:1
msgid "Initialize controller joint-planning limits from a local configuration file."
msgstr "从本地配置文件初始化控制器关节规划限位。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.stopRunPln_joint:1
msgid "Stop the active joint or Cartesian plan for arm A or B."
msgstr "停止 A 臂或 B 臂正在执行的关节或笛卡尔规划。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Concise_Marvin_Robot.setPln_joint_AB:1
#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.setPln_joint_AB:1
msgid ""
"Start both arms' joint-space plans together using seven-element start/end vectors and"
" velocity/acceleration ratios."
msgstr "使用七元素起止向量及速度和加速度比例，同时启动双臂关节空间规划。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Concise_Marvin_Robot.setPln_Cart_AB:1
#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.setPln_Cart_AB:1
msgid ""
"Run two seven-dimensional PointSet trajectories together. Raw integer pointers are "
"not accepted."
msgstr "同时运行两组七维 PointSet 轨迹，不接受整数指针。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Concise_Marvin_Robot.stopPln_AB:1
#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.stopPln_AB:1
msgid "Stop planning on both arms."
msgstr "停止双臂规划。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.setPln_joint:1
msgid ""
"Plan joint-space movement between two seven-joint vectors using velocity and "
"acceleration ratios in (0, 1]."
msgstr "在两组七关节向量之间规划关节空间运动，速度和加速度比例范围为 (0, 1]。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.setPln_Cart:1
msgid ""
"Run a seven-dimensional PointSet trajectory on arm A or B without transferring C++ "
"object ownership."
msgstr "在 A 臂或 B 臂运行七维 PointSet 轨迹，不转移 C++ 对象所有权。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.clear_485_cache:1
msgid "Clear the selected arm's end-effector communication buffer."
msgstr "清空指定机械臂末端通信缓冲区。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.set_485_data:1
msgid ""
"Send at most 256 bytes to the selected end-effector channel: 1 CAN/CANFD, 2 COM1, or "
"3 COM2."
msgstr "向指定末端通道发送最多 256 字节：1 CAN/CANFD、2 COM1 或 3 COM2。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.get_485_data:1
msgid ""
"Read end-effector communication data and return the SDK status plus its hexadecimal "
"byte string."
msgstr "读取末端通信数据，返回 SDK 状态和十六进制字节字符串。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.set_PD_vel_est_step:1
msgid "Set the velocity-estimation step for the selected arm in milliseconds."
msgstr "设置指定机械臂的速度估计步长，单位为毫秒。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Concise_Marvin_Robot.get_robot_name:1
#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.get_robot_name:1
msgid "Download and read the controller robot name as UTF-8 text, returning None on failure."
msgstr "下载并以 UTF-8 文本读取控制器机器人名称，失败时返回 None。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Concise_Marvin_Robot.reset_6dof_force_sensor:1
#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.reset_6dof_force_sensor:1
msgid "Request zeroing of the selected arm's six-axis force sensor."
msgstr "请求对指定机械臂的六维力传感器进行清零。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Concise_Marvin_Robot.set_system_time:1
#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.set_system_time:1
msgid ""
"Set controller calendar time using year, month, day, hour, minute and scenod (the "
"official seconds argument name)."
msgstr "使用年月日时分和 scenod 设置控制器时间，scenod 为官方秒参数名称。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Concise_Marvin_Robot.reboot:1 pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.reboot:1
msgid "Request a controller reboot and return the SDK status."
msgstr "请求控制器重启，并返回 SDK 状态。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Concise_Marvin_Robot.stop_running:1
#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.stop_running:1
msgid "Request a motion stop for A, B or AB. The official Python wrapper returns None."
msgstr "请求 A、B 或 AB 停止运动；官方 Python 包装层返回 None。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Concise_Marvin_Robot.get_tool_info:1
#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.get_tool_info:1
msgid "Download tool kinematic/dynamic data and decode the official two-line, 16-column file."
msgstr "下载工具运动学和动力学数据，并解析官方两行、16 列文件。"

#: pymarvin.fx_kine.Marvin_Kine.help:1 pymarvin.fx_robot.Concise_Marvin_Robot.help:1
#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Marvin_Robot.help:1
msgid "Print public method signatures or the documentation for method_name."
msgstr "打印公开方法签名或 method_name 指定方法的文档。"

#: ../../api/_generated/pymarvin.rst:11
msgid "pymarvin.Concise_Marvin_Robot"
msgstr "pymarvin.Concise_Marvin_Robot"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Concise_Marvin_Robot:1
msgid ""
"Controller interface that batches commands and checks errors inside the SDK. "
"Instances share SDK state."
msgstr "由 SDK 内部批量发送指令并检查错误的控制器接口；实例共享 SDK 状态。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Concise_Marvin_Robot.check_arms_error:1
msgid "Check and clear arm-state errors using the concise SDK interface."
msgstr "通过简化 SDK 接口检查并清除机械臂状态错误。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Concise_Marvin_Robot.check_servo_error:1
msgid "Check and clear servo errors using the concise SDK interface."
msgstr "通过简化 SDK 接口检查并清除伺服错误。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Concise_Marvin_Robot.start_collect_data:1
msgid ""
"Start recording up to 35 telemetry fields, clamping record count to 1,000 through "
"1,000,000."
msgstr "开始记录最多 35 项遥测数据，记录数限制为 1,000 至 1,000,000。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Concise_Marvin_Robot.save_gather_data:1
msgid "Save recorded telemetry in the SDK data-file format."
msgstr "按 SDK 数据文件格式保存已采集的遥测数据。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Concise_Marvin_Robot.save_gather_data_as_csv_to_path:1
msgid "Save recorded telemetry as CSV using the concise interface's conversion format."
msgstr "按简化接口的转换格式将已采集遥测数据保存为 CSV。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Concise_Marvin_Robot.set_position_state:1
msgid "Enter position mode with velocity and acceleration percentages for arm A or B."
msgstr "按指定速度和加速度百分比将 A 臂或 B 臂切换到位置模式。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Concise_Marvin_Robot.set_imp_joint_state:1
msgid "Enter joint impedance mode with seven stiffness and damping values."
msgstr "使用 7 项刚度和阻尼参数进入关节阻抗模式。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Concise_Marvin_Robot.set_imp_cart_state:1
msgid ""
"Enter Cartesian impedance mode with stiffness, damping and end-effector rotation "
"parameters."
msgstr "使用刚度、阻尼和末端旋转参数进入笛卡尔阻抗模式。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Concise_Marvin_Robot.set_imp_force_state:1
msgid "Enter force impedance mode using a six-element force direction and adjustment limit."
msgstr "使用六元素力方向和调节限幅进入力阻抗模式。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Concise_Marvin_Robot.set_joint_position_cmd:1
msgid "Send a seven-joint position command in degrees through the concise interface."
msgstr "通过简化接口发送单位为度的七关节位置指令。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Concise_Marvin_Robot.run_pln_joint:1
msgid "Run a joint-space plan between seven-joint start/end vectors using ratios in (0, 1]."
msgstr "使用 (0, 1] 范围内的比例，在七关节起止向量之间运行关节空间规划。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Concise_Marvin_Robot.run_pln_cart:1
msgid "Run a seven-dimensional PointSet trajectory through the concise interface."
msgstr "通过简化接口运行七维 PointSet 轨迹。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Concise_Marvin_Robot.stop_pln:1
msgid "Stop the selected arm's active plan."
msgstr "停止指定机械臂当前的规划。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Concise_Marvin_Robot.send_pvt:1
msgid "Upload a local PVT file to the selected arm's trajectory identifier."
msgstr "将本地 PVT 文件上传至指定机械臂的轨迹编号。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Concise_Marvin_Robot.run_pvt:1
msgid "Run a previously uploaded PVT trajectory identifier."
msgstr "运行已上传的指定编号 PVT 轨迹。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Concise_Marvin_Robot.set_joint_drag:1
msgid "Enter joint dragging after configuring the required joint impedance mode."
msgstr "在配置所需关节阻抗模式后进入关节拖动。"

#: pymarvin.fx_robot.Concise_Marvin_Robot.set_cart_drag:1
msgid ""
"Enter Cartesian dragging for X, Y, Z or R (rotation). Exit dragging before selecting "
"another mode."
msgstr "进入 X、Y、Z 或 R 旋转方向的笛卡尔拖动，切换模式前应先退出拖动。"

